[00:00.000] 作曲 : Garrett Clark Borns
[00:00.300]Past lives couldn't ever hold me down
{"前世从未能将我束缚"}
[00:04.213]Lost love is sweeter when it's finally found
{"失而复得的爱才更甜蜜"}
[00:08.271]I've got the strangest feeling
{"我有种最奇异的感觉"}
[00:12.361]This isn't our first time around
{"这并非我们初次相遇"}
[00:16.498]Past lives couldn't ever come between us
{"前世从未能阻隔我们"}
[00:20.537]Some time the dreamers finally wake up
{"有时梦想家终会醒来"}
